.wrangler/

# ─── Static artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Static copies not needed in version control.
Tukuk-Os.html

# ─── Session scratch (.artifacts) ───────────────────────────────
# 130+ probe/bench/CDP/screenshot files written while debugging live production: `git status
# --porcelain -uall` was 201 lines long, which is how a real change gets lost in the noise.
# More than tidiness — nothing in here may be staged by accident. /opt/tukuk-os is a git
# clone that updates itself with `git merge --ff-only`, and a path that becomes TRACKED while
# an untracked copy already sits on the box makes that merge refuse (measured in a scratch
# repo: rc=1, "The following untracked working tree files would be overwritten by merge",
# HEAD unchanged; the same merge fast-forwards once the file is removed). The nightly timer
# stops dead and every skipped run exits 0. Measured 29 Oct 2026, the box's own
# `.artifacts/` holds nothing but the five files negated below (its status is clean apart
# from the etc-netplan-reference/ files further down), so this is one careless `git add -A`
# away from that collision rather than today's news. Same class as the
# public/downloads/tukuk-km*.apk rule below, which is the version of this that already bit
# the repo. Those five files ARE intentional history — deploy/GCP-FREE-TIER.md cites one of
# them by path.
.artifacts/*
!.artifacts/aliyun_probe.py
!.artifacts/geo-fix-redirects.js
!.artifacts/geo-migrate.js
!.artifacts/sitemap-migrate.js
# A negated directory alone would re-include EVERY file inside it, so the third line
# re-excludes the contents and the fourth brings back the one page that is real history.
# (Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded — hence the order.)
!.artifacts/d0a2208f-c940-48a0-ae36-17d63af3a2dd/
.artifacts/d0a2208f-c940-48a0-ae36-17d63af3a2dd/*
!.artifacts/d0a2208f-c940-48a0-ae36-17d63af3a2dd/deploy_iso_guide.artifact.md

# ─── OS & editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ─── Electron build output ───────────────────────────────────
dist/
datasets/
node_modules/
meili_data/

# ─── AI models (ONNX/GGUF) ────────────────────────────────────
